{"content":[{"c":["ZUPH (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Ancestor of Elkanah, the father of the prophet Samuel (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.1.1","r":"1Sam.1.1","rawR":"1Sam.1.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.1.1","value":"1Sam.1.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 1:1"},"). Zuph was a member of the Kohathite branch of Levites and is listed as the son of Elkanah (different than above) and the father of Toah (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.35","r":"1Chr.6.35","rawR":"1Chr.6.35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.35","value":"1Chr.6.35"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:35"},"). He is the same as Zophai listed in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.26","r":"1Chr.6.26","rawR":"1Chr.6.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.26","value":"1Chr.6.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 6:26"},". It is evident that Zuph was a Levite, even though he is listed as an Ephraimite in the 1 Samuel passage."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"ZuphPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Sm 1:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.1.1","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.1.1","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.1.1"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:35","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.35","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.35","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.35"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 6:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.26","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.26","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.26"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e0c78c2411b9b751841671ec3128705385b31396ffb8ae4d3bf239b042297eb6","sourceItemName":"ZuphPerson","sourceItemOrder":158,"sourceMember":"Articles/Z.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"ZuphPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Zuph (Person)","title":"Zuph (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}